{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c39b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a16f29-8a52-78e0-a3b7-ac73629a118d"},"sequence":40,"recorded_at":1780531400000075,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a16f29-9139-7d63-bf27-9f131bb65f9f","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"01a16f29-9139-7d63-bf27-9f131bb65f9f","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"01a16f29-9139-7d63-bf27-9f131bb65f9f"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a16f29-d4f0-7303-8e06-9dca5f560f2d"},"task_id":"01a16f29-d4f0-7303-8e06-9dca5f560f2d","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a16f29-d4f0-7303-8e06-9dca5f560f2d","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/opencode-zen-tool-invoke-fix/.ai-team/runs/opencode-zen-tool-invoke-fix-20261024/coder.json`.\n1|{\n2|  \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n3|  \"role\": \"coder\",\n4|  \"task_id\": \"OPENCODE-ZEN-TOOL-INVOKE-FIX\",\n5|  \"iteration\": 1,\n6|  \"status\": \"DONE\",\n7|  \"summary\": \"Re-baselined the untracked opencode-zen-bridge copy on current live (sha 90b1d664…, 3902 lines), wrote red tests first, then implemented AD-001..AD-004 with the ARCH_PANEL Skeptic hardening: trailing-brace recovery (1..16 extra '}', RecursionError-safe, quiet flag against log amplification) and OpenAI 'function' unwrap in opencode-zen/core/muse; _strip_broken_tool_blocks (fail-closed at the 17th candidate) wired into _sanitize_assistant_text, _incomplete_tool_step_prompt, _stream_sse and _serve_json with a one-line notice when nothing else is visible. VER-001/003/004 green, VER-002 failure set identical to the 3-test baseline. Nothing committed or deployed; live ~/.dsh bridge and ~/work/src/cli-agent-bridge untouched.\",\n8|  \"changed_files\": [\n9|    \"bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py\",\n10|    \"bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/tests/test_lenient_tool_call.py\",\n11|    \"bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/tests/test_step_interruption.py\",\n12|    \"core/tool_emulation.py\",\n13|    \"bridges/muse-bridge/server.py\",\n14|    \"tests/test_tool_parser.py\"\n15|  ],\n16|  \"commands\": [\n17|    {\n18|      \"command\": \"python3 -m unittest tests.test_tool_parser -v\",\n19|      \"exit_code\": 0\n20|    },\n21|    {\n22|      \"command\": \"cd bridges/opencode-zen-bridge && python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -t . (failure set == baseline: 3 test_unmapped_* tests; Ran 378, errors=0)\",\n23|      \"exit_code\": 1\n24|    },\n25|    {\n26|      \"command\": \"cd bridges/opencode-zen-bridge && python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -t . -k negative_control -k unparsed_block_returned_as_text -k closed_batch_without_intermediate_close_kept -k sanitize_closed_alt_batch_kept -k broken_block -k history_renders_tool_calls (Ran 12)\",\n27|      \"exit_code\": 0\n28|    },\n29|    {\n30|      \"command\": \"cd bridges/opencode-zen-bridge && python3 -c <VER-004 verbatim logic> (0.318/0.15/1.992 ms)\",\n31|      \"exit_code\": 0\n32|    },\n33|    {\n34|      \"command\": \"uvx ruff check core/tool_emulation.py bridges/muse-bridge/server.py tests/test_tool_parser.py\",\n35|      \"exit_code\": 0\n36|    },\n37|    {\n38|      \"command\": \"python3 -m unittest discover -s tests (repo root, Ran 899; 2 failures reproduce on clean HEAD: test_b_guard.test_tm018_live_check_subprocess, test_muse_bridge_killpg.test_t00_models_and_health_include_wonder_models_400k)\",\n39|      \"exit_code\": 1\n40|    }\n41|  ],\n42|  \"acceptance_coverage\": [\n43|    {\n44|      \"requirement_id\": \"REQ-001\",\n45|      \"status\": \"COVERED\",\n46|      \"evidence\": \"_loads_lenient/_recover_trailing_braces (+core/muse _loads_tolerant); tests test_trailing_braces_recovered, test_production_payload_single_call, test_trailing_garbage_not_recovered, contract cases trailing_braces*; stream/json single-spawn tests\"\n47|    },\n48|    {\n49|      \"requirement_id\": \"REQ-002\",\n50|      \"status\": \"COVERED\",\n51|      \"evidence\": \"_strip_broken_tool_blocks at _stream_sse sink, _serve_json and _incomplete_tool_step_prompt; test_stream_broken_block_not_in_sse_nor_reprompt, test_json_broken_block_not_in_content_nor_reprompt, test_stream_notice_when_only_broken_block, test_serve_json_*; fail-closed cap test_strip_cap_is_fail_closed and test_strip_scan_is_bounded_broken_block\"\n52|    },\n53|    {\n54|      \"requirement_id\": \"REQ-003\",\n55|      \"status\": \"COVERED\",\n56|      \"evidence\": \"_sanitize_assistant_text strips closed malformed blocks (quiet); test_sanitize_strips_malformed_closed_tool_invoke; kept-batch tests unchanged and green; OpenAI function wrapper parity in all three parsers\"\n57|    },\n58|    {\n59|      \"requirement_id\": \"REQ-004\",\n60|      \"status\": \"COVERED\",\n61|      \"evidence\": \"18 new tests in bridges/opencode-zen-bridge (VER-002 378 = 360 + 18), 8 new in tests/test_tool_parser.py (VER-001 52 = 44 + 8), red phase observed before the fix\"\n62|    }\n63|  ],\n64|  \"assumptions\": [\n65|    \"Live opencode-zen server.py changed again between arch-spec (sha 5f6b7cb0, 3885 lines) and re-baseline (sha 90b1d664, 3902 lines); all anchors were re-resolved by symbol. The rollout sha guard must compare live against 90b1d66499dceadac24f7990423b4c53b2ebd5b23247aaf50efe187851598b9e and merge-file if it moved again.\",\n66|    \"Fail-closed cap (brief/ARCH_PANEL k=1) supersedes the fail-open wording of arch-spec 4.3 step 2: the 17th candidate outside markdown code drops the rest of the text.\",\n67|    \"The three pre-existing baseline failures (test_unmapped_*) are baseline debt: neither fixed nor regressed.\",\n68|    \"The log label for the cap is tool_strip_cap_hit (not tool_block_strip_cap_reached): the 28-char label was masked to '***' by _mask_secrets (24+ char token rule).\"\n69|  ],\n70|  \"risks\": [\n71|    \"The cap counts every candidate outside markdown code, valid ones included: a replayed history message with more than 16 separately closed blocks loses the 17th and later ones in _sanitize_assistant_text (sinks never see valid blocks).\",\n72|    \"Google-direct stream path (_stream_google, own ToolCallParser/emit_content) is not routed through the strip sink; out of scope of arch-spec 4.4 and of the incident (GLM via opencode CLI).\",\n73|    \"opencode-zen _normalize_arguments now also accepts a string-encoded arguments object with extra trailing '}' because it goes through _loads_lenient (core/muse _normalize_arguments stay strict).\",\n74|    \"Root-suite failures test_b_guard.test_tm018_live_check_subprocess and test_muse_bridge_killpg.test_t00_models_and_health_include_wonder_models_400k are environment-dependent and fail identically on clean HEAD.\",\n75|    \"Not deployed: heavy-path check on :9883 and launchctl kickstart (arch-spec 9 rollout steps 2-5) remain for the orchestrator/verifier; bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/ is git-untracked, nothing committed.\"\n76|  ],\n77|  \"open_questions\": [],\n78|  \"next_role\": \"reviewer\",\n79|  \"role_plan\": {\n80|    \"path\": \"plans/coder-01.json\",\n81|    \"sha256\": \"6c47bd81d6c0468e8b03b93199bc919d3d80a3744097cefe2d1c8e3720bfe5bb\"\n82|  }\n83|}","final_result":true}}}
