{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3a3","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a16f29-8a52-78e0-a3b7-ac73629a118d"},"sequence":44,"recorded_at":1780531400000083,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a16f29-9139-7d63-bf27-9f131bb65f9f","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"01a16f29-9139-7d63-bf27-9f131bb65f9f","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"01a16f29-9139-7d63-bf27-9f131bb65f9f"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a16f29-d491-7ce0-9267-e31bf50da081"},"task_id":"01a16f29-d491-7ce0-9267-e31bf50da081","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a16f29-d491-7ce0-9267-e31bf50da081","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/opencode-zen-tool-invoke-fix/.ai-team/runs/opencode-zen-tool-invoke-fix-20261024/teamlead/package.md`.\n1|# Teamlead Code Council Package — OPENCODE-ZEN-TOOL-INVOKE-FIX\n2|\n3|## 1. Executive Summary & Requirements Traceability\n4|- **Task / Run ID:** `OPENCODE-ZEN-TOOL-INVOKE-FIX` / `opencode-zen-tool-invoke-fix-20261024`\n5|- **Preset:** `analyst-teamlead` (`child_preset=teamlead-with-architect`, `criticality=S2`)\n6|- **Architecture Packet SHA-256:** `42c8a5c77d48ae612b8bda503bcb31577b22222fad54767715975e1c0c3e85b4` (`ARCH_PANEL` `panel-proof.json` `sha256=6136dd14625b06d6719bdcb9e3ab0a5cd5ff46e3a3af3efc1a3a06e36a6da95a`, `exit=0`)\n7|- **Requirements Covered:**\n8|  - `REQ-001` (`AD-001`): `_recover_trailing_braces` in `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py`, `core/tool_emulation.py`, and `bridges/muse-bridge/server.py` recovers valid JSON `dict` tool calls followed by 1..16 extra closing braces `}` (with `RecursionError` protection and `quiet` flag for history sanitization).\n9|  - `REQ-002` (`AD-002`): `_strip_broken_tool_blocks` (with fail-closed tail truncation on the 17th candidate outside markdown code per `ARCH_PANEL` Skeptic `k=1`) strips unparseable raw `<tool_call>`/`<tool_invoke>` blocks at 3 sinks (`Handler._stream_sse`, `Handler._serve_json`, `_incomplete_tool_step_prompt`), emitting `_BROKEN_BLOCK_NOTICE` only when nothing else is visible, while keeping `_split_tool_calls` and `_is_incomplete_tool_step` untouched.\n10|  - `REQ-003` (`AD-003`): `_sanitize_assistant_text` strips closed malformed `<tool_call>`/`<tool_invoke>` blocks (`quiet=True`) while keeping valid closed single/multi-call batches byte-identical; `_parse_tool_call_block` unwraps OpenAI `{\"function\": {\"name\": ..., \"arguments\": ...}}` when top-level `\"name\"` is absent; `_render_tool_call` preserves `\"id\"`.\n11|  - `REQ-004` (`AD-004`): Cross-bridge contract tests (`tests/test_tool_parser.py`: 52 tests OK) + bridge unit tests (`test_lenient_tool_call.py`, `test_step_interruption.py`: +18 new tests, 378 total).\n12|\n13|## 2. L1 & Clean-Room L2 Verification Evidence\n14|- **VER-001 (`python3 -m unittest tests.test_tool_parser -v`):** `Ran 52 tests in 0.154s — OK` (44 baseline + 8 new).\n15|- **VER-002 (`bridges/opencode-zen-bridge` full suite):** `Ran 378 tests` (360 baseline + 18 new; 0 errors; only the 3 pre-existing `test_unmapped_*` baseline failures from live `MAX_TOTAL_SPAWNS=3`).\n16|- **VER-003 (`-k negative_control ... -k broken_block ...`):** `Ran 12 tests in 10.177s — OK`.\n17|- **VER-004 (60 KiB H-CPU performance gate < 5 ms):** `0.42 ms` (60 KiB `}}}`), `0.148 ms` (60 KiB unterminated), `1.949 ms` (60 KiB broken block strip) — exit 0.\n18|- **Clean-Room L2 Sensitivity Proof (`/tmp/cel-runs/opencode-zen-tool-invoke-fix-20261024/cleanroom-l2`):**\n19|  - Red check against unpatched `baseline-live-server.py`: `FAILED (failures=12)` (`RED_RC=1`).\n20|  - Green check against candidate `server.py` and `core`/`muse`: `Ran 11 tests in 0.060s — OK` and `Ran 52 tests — OK`.\n21|\n22|## 3. Unified Diff — `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` (vs live baseline `90b1d664...`)\n23|```diff\n24|--- /tmp/cel-runs/opencode-zen-tool-invoke-fix-20261024/baseline-live-server.py\t2026-10-24 20:3